message: "If you use this code or results, please cite the article."
title: "cmf-chronos-fusion: code and results for pre-tokenization multivariate fusion with a frozen Chronos-T5"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-18"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24330607"
abstract: "Code, data-preparation scripts, frozen experiment protocols and per-origin results for Chronos Multivariate Fusion (CMF), a context-local adapter that compresses a multivariate history into the scalar history accepted by a frozen Chronos-T5 forecaster, evaluated on eight public energy datasets with validation-tuned mechanism controls, matched baselines and an expanded evaluation."
keywords:
  - Chronos Foundation Model
  - Energy Forecasting
  - Multivariate Time Series
  - Probabilistic Forecasting
  - Statistical Significance
